  "description" : "account receives a large domestic wire and sends almost all of it onward to a different party the same day, retaining a small balance"
}

{
  "case_id" : "CAS-00002",
  "justification" : "C1059 received a 48,000.00 CAD wire from EXT-2224 (TX-00454, 2026-09-16) and sent 45,500.00 CAD by wire to EXT-2137 (TX-00496, 2026-09-16) about five hours later, passing on 94.8% of the funds the same day. The account has no other activity in the data (2026-09-01 to 2026-09-26), no other counterparties, and no legitimate business explanation is visible. Same-day in-and-out movement of wire funds through an account with no evident purpose gives reasonable grounds to suspect a pass-through or layering role. No similar precedent was found."
}
